## Step 4: Algorithmic Solution
### Selected Sub-Problem: 1. The system has difficulty handling transactions efficiently because several
parts of the process are performed inefficently.
### Pseudocode
START

Greet customer
Ask for order
Record order

Ask if they want anything else
IF yes
    Add to order
END IF

Confirm order
Calculate total
Tell customer total

Ask for payment
Process payment
Give change if needed

Give receipt
Thank customer

END
